    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d484">

                <pb facs="0852" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg720"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860c.01/6–2145: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 484<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Harriman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent—niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-06-22T15:00:00-04:00">June 22, 1945—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1370. Dept concurs in your action as
                    Commissioner in accepting the settlement.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d484-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>For your information, I have telegraphed the President<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d484-f2"/> giving him an outline of your 2218, June 21,<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d484-f3"/> regarding agreement on Polish Government. I have
                    recommended that he give favorable consideration, if the British Government
                    concurs, to grant recognition to the newly-constituted government as the new
                    Polish Provisional Government of National Unity.</p>
                <p>As soon as I hear from the President I shall inform you of his decision.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
